+def _record_in_the_gate(repo, table, path, key, record):
+    """the recorded act: an entry added to `table` in the small repository's gates, whatever the table already holds.  The
+    statement that binds the table is found in the syntax tree, and the entry is added on the line after it, before
+    anything reads the table.  (2026-11-12, series 4, patch 10.  Until then the entry was planted by rewriting the text of
